# Let a synced block state its own mining feel. Breaking is predicted entirely on the client, off
# the stand-in's properties, so a stand-in cloned from a base that disagrees with the real block
# digs at the wrong speed for the whole dig. Properties can set this flag but has no way to clear
# it, and the case that matters is exactly clearing it: a block deciding drops per-part wants no
# tool requirement while its base block, chosen for sound and feel, has one.
accessible field net/minecraft/world/level/block/state/BlockBehaviour$Properties requiresCorrectToolForDrops Z
mutable field net/minecraft/world/level/block/state/BlockBehaviour$Properties requiresCorrectToolForDrops Z
